    "title": "Special Weather Statement by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here At 937 PM CDT, trained weather spotters reported a strong thunderstorm 17 miles southwest of McCamey, moving northeast at 10 mph. HAZARD...Wind gusts up to 50 mph and half inch hail. SOURCE...Trained weather spotters. IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around unsecured objects. Minor hail damage to vegetation is possible. Locations impacted include... McCamey, Girvin, and Upton County Airport. This includes Interstate 10 near mile marker 290.",
